        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "contract, the Company shall increase the number of full time forty (40) hour merchandise handling positions in the Stonestown Store at no less than six (6). The Company subsequently agrees to maintain these full time merchandise-handling positions as designated in Section 5A. All subsequent full time positions shall be offered as per Section 17E.",
