        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a. Employer may implement overnight processing at Stonestown if necessary during the life of the contract, but agrees to give the Union six (6) months advance notice of implementation and subject to all of the same terms applicable at Union Square and specified in the Side Letter.",
